description=Runtime engine patches for Titan Quest (Android, arm64): direct calls instead of PLT, sound and short-effect caches, attack-slot, shader-uniform, ray-box and path-end-point fixes. Includes an in-game options menu (Perf button) to toggle every patch and hidden graphics flags. Hosts add-ons such as tq-traders in the same single injection. Each patch checks function fingerprints and switches itself off on unknown builds. Status: /data/user/0/com.hg.titanquestultimate/cache/tq-v2-status.json
